{
  "_comment": "Shared weight-resolution test vectors. python_cases pin the build-time engine (font_module._inspect_font); shell_filename_cases pin the flash-time filename heuristic (find_best_face in template/customize.sh) via tests/shell/run_find_best_face.sh. Keep both engines green against this file so they cannot drift apart.",
